  (descr "TI RGE0024R VQFN-24, 4 x 4 mm, 0.5 mm pitch, 2.1 mm thermal pad and four corner VSS pads (A1-A4), as the TAC5212 uses. From TI's example board layout and stencil design for RGE0024R (4225246/A, 08/2019) in the TAC5212 datasheet: pads 0.24 x 0.6 mm, rows 3.8 mm apart; corner pads 0.25 mm square, 3.45 mm apart; paste on the thermal pad as four 0.94 mm squares (80 %). TI's optional 0.2 mm vias in the thermal pad are left to the layout. KiCad's Texas_RGE0024H has a 2.7 mm pad and no corner pads")
